WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.312
The bottom line is that infinite-width theory now
reaches the Jacobian.

00:00:04.392 --> 00:00:08.457
Train a wide network with a Jacobian regulariser
and, in the limit,

00:00:08.537 --> 00:00:12.911
it behaves like kernel regression with a Jacobian
Neural Tangent Kernel.

00:00:12.991 --> 00:00:19.964
And that same regulariser makes accuracy and
robustness pull in the same direction instead of fighting each other,

00:00:20.044 --> 00:00:24.789
giving us the first principled explanation, from
the infinite-width viewpoint,

00:00:24.869 --> 00:00:29.800
of why penalising the Jacobian yields networks that
are both accurate and robust.
